{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"9thシングルの特典映像は個人PV。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"youtubeの公式チャンネルに\n予告編がアップされました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのはType-Cに収録されてます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のテーマは しりとり！\n歌もちょっとだけ歌いました♪\nお楽しみにっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SHIRITORI HOUSE\n中元日芽香×月田茂・山本篤彦・柴谷麻衣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回の乃木ののは\nみおちゃん(堀未央奈ちゃん)\nさゆりんご(松村沙友理ちゃん)です☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文化放送はお休みなので\nラジオ福島、青森放送、山梨放送のみ\nお届けします( ´ ▽ ` )ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送圏にお住まいの方は\nよろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"火曜、水曜は撮影をしてきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"火曜日は乃木どこ♪\n水曜日は......まだ内緒♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみにヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういや明日の沈黙の金曜日で\n9thアンダー楽曲解禁！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは焼肉のタレは甘口、中辛、辛口、\nどれが好きですか？\nこれは甘口派！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ慣れしてない初心者は\nどんな用意で参加したらいいですかね？\n推しメンタオルとか推しメンTシャツとか\n推しメンうちわとかおすすめ( ^O^ )\nはじめて参加するよーって方なら\nとりあえずサイリウムとか持つだけでも\n楽しいと思う♪\nちなみにひめたんはピンクのサイリウムが好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆にこんな難しい漢字\n書けるんだよーってのはあるの？\n「とりりーぬさん」とか。\n「鳥氏」←これじゃない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不二家でまなったんが\n「たんひめ、ケーキどれにする」って\nペコちゃんに話しかけてたらどうする？\nおともだちだって思われたら恥ずかしいから\n他人のフリする、かな(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは家族からは何て呼ばれてるの？\nひめ、ひめたん、ひめすけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはこの漢字読める？\n『蛸』\n別にぼけなくていいよ、ぼけなくていいから。\nなにこれフリ？\n私は空気は読まないよ＼(^o^)／たこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたーん！！！\n文化祭で写真撮るとき、\nひめたんビーム使っていい？\n良かったらひめたんビームで返してー\n(<・ω・>)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"国語・数学・理科・社会・英語\nの中でひめたんが好きな教科って何ー？？\n国語！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの日記の\nコメント欄下２ケタに46を踏んだ方へ\n手書きでコメ返するコーナー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ ひめたん46 ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントたくさん\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル終わって一息......と思いきや\nなんだかんだでバタバタの毎日\nうん、なんか乃木充してるぞ(＊´ω`＊)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからはライブづくしじゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2014/06/19/8966812/0002.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}